# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what ships in the .vsix.
# An allowlist (instead of a denylist) because vsce does not read .gitignore, and
# untracked local files (CLAUDE.md, .claude/) would otherwise leak into a public package.
# vsce always includes package.json and the README. Never combine with `files` in
# package.json: vsce aborts when both exist.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview/**
!media/**
!LICENSE*
!CHANGELOG.md
